 "title": "Unidirectional 12 V ESD protection diode, normal capacitance, SOD-523",
 "source": {
  "revision": "Rev:2.0",
  "pages": 3
 },
 "summary": "A single unidirectional transient-suppression diode in the SOD-523 surface-mount package. It stands off up to 12 V, breaks down between 13.2 V and 16 V, and clamps to 24 V at most while carrying 15 A of 8/20 µs surge. It withstands ±30 kV ESD by both the air and contact methods of IEC 61000-4-2, with 90 pF maximum junction capacitance and 0.1 µA maximum leakage. Uses named for it are handsets and accessories, PDAs, notebooks and handhelds, peripherals, audio players and industrial equipment.",
